      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "金阁寺本名鹿苑寺，1397年由足利义满建造。",
      "sha256": "3cd4ee4af06a928f566bba0be83ad65e510d9069bec7dad9cf2af9a12ba1c2c3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 11,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "三层楼阁贴满金箔，整座建筑倒映在镜湖池里。",
      "sha256": "6513e2ce7c21722a83b5eed9d507bc951a245f88bc1c4ad790166928c08e953e",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "春天樱花，冬天白雪，人们说，这就是日本的美。",
      "sha256": "92b89bcc744bf379b6c723ed7749057af8cfd47cef5a26480922b505bd8be63d",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 23,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "夏夜，萤火点点，僧人站在池边，久久望着金阁。",
      "sha256": "539c9b563bbd3fc459c396a79435503000778afe786ba25e230c94fc7b765fe7",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "他叫林养贤，1929年生在京都北边的舞鹤。",
      "sha256": "b3790d2e6c224006205274ca592a87977b9343144284d8b5c5c5b74003127b5c",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 37,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "家里是一座小寺院。他从小就口吃，一开口就被嘲笑。",
      "sha256": "47a01624142686e04da2b783b5f5aa61ccae1e53436caf15abefac5d6b1d7abe",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 43,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "父亲病逝后，十六岁的他被送进金阁寺，成了见习僧。",
      "sha256": "f06bcd10a34475a4b9de452730769544433a9f01d1cc24b59dec4c10741e77ed",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 50,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "他仰头看着金阁的屋脊，眼睛里全是金光。",
      "sha256": "7596bddf514a651dcb25b197ef38713f9c2f45ec7bc2077488c1290b61701bc3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 56,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "他一边在寺里修行，一边在大谷大学读书。",
      "sha256": "06fd5b8919c5627486988600f10ef6242b91fd7428153b8c6047b2637611561d",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 61,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "可口吃让他在人群里越来越沉默。",
      "sha256": "684fbec68bbbe26b30b3d992e4d1d5a80b5d2e38e6226d23391ca6f66235a741",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 66,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "战后的金阁寺，游客排队买票，寺院靠门票赚钱。",
      "sha256": "fd81ef21d807d00be595792b7888b984e952b88a5c8bd7567965e6b9cee40dbc",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 70,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "他看不惯这些。他和住持之间，也慢慢有了隔阂。",
      "sha256": "b43675ff1ef5d67611cb5e41d8473a4d27738bc789639632a59a5100084f11f3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 77,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "1950年7月1日深夜，他提着旧布包，走过回廊。",
      "sha256": "9e870475fdeff2062a007fe26efef2db9029b079201bd12ed01ce13f65b6bf8d",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
