      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "没有人员伤亡。可是火起的时候，警报器没有响。",
      "sha256": "6d5f3eeb939df3a7a96352fe04af97b7fc858da87a231d05c981240d0200545f",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 107,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "屋顶塌了，五百年的国宝和足利义满的木像，全成了灰。",
      "sha256": "25b008207602303de4c724561290aee9378969445e622fa8e97e438b4ab1c7fc",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 112,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "天亮以后，废墟还在冒烟，焦黑的木头立在晨光里。",
      "sha256": "190f3fe1b644e84b953753d00907df47644bec01b23383772201309684acfcaa",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 119,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "那天傍晚，警方在后山找到了他。他也曾想过结束自己的生命。",
      "sha256": "0a19042ab3e02c92607d058015c71ec090698b1cd3a7d83a1e214b24835c34fa",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "审讯室里，他低着头说，他嫉妒金阁的美。",
      "sha256": "fb20e4f496f340c9e094efd8f563f01ce6ae6d84e1f65f1fa66cccc5a9e218cb",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 132,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "有时又说，他厌恶寺院里的钱味。供词前后不一。",
      "sha256": "f316ea067ea684515cef6e2c7aba433a6bf41810d7701bbb0924824255107cff",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "事发后，母亲被叫到京都。她一直盼着儿子当住持。",
      "sha256": "00b19bf65eb5477c3d81709339483bf2339990affeadafeed972bdadacefc4bb",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 143,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "她没能见到儿子。回程的火车上，她走了。",
      "sha256": "9ba773b5fb529541280c2774bc088404d92975233062e6c4283b2640a707afe8",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
