    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "1955年，金阁重建，金光又一次洒满镜湖池。",
      "sha256": "43df94dedf8a6ece4242ae90c11fb1e518853b6a0c65a5ea4e5133e4629db2fd",
